Z||000016||FieroMaster88||08-13-2001||04:33 PM||||sorry to hear that cliff.  I was really mad when someone tried to break into my car.  They did $1400 worth of damage and the body shop could not find half the parts that were needed.  I had to find them and then bill my insurance company.  What a pain.  I hope everything works out ok for you.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||1
